'''Koneko Music Festival''' (こねこ音楽祭, ''Koneko Ongakusai'', '''Koneko Music Festival''') is an event that was added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]] and appears during [[Million Downloads Event]]s. It is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]]. The first stage is accessible from the start of the event, while the second and third become available later on. This event features a mechanic where producing Cat units and defeating enemies will earn the player "Event Points", which can grant rewards after certain milestones have been achieved.

