The limited event "Koneko Music Festival" is on now!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from October 12th (11:00 AM) until October 26th (10:59 AM)!'''}}

{{Color|#980000|'''・Event Map: "Koneko Takes the Stage"'''}}<br>
