==Event Point Information==
Event points are earned by producing Cat units and defeating enemies. Points earned are based on [Unit Cost × Event Point Multiplier]. [[Talents#Buffs|Cost Reduction Talents]]/[[Talent Orbs|Orbs]] do not affect the amount of Event Points earned. Each stage has a time limit of three minutes and enemies will begin to drop fewer points as the timer progresses.

Earning Event Points during a battle contributes toward filling a "Fever Gauge", which, when maxed, will reduce the recharge time of all units to zero for a short period.

